keys to move,
left click to parry"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="introLabel3" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=409929024]
z_index = -1
texture_filter = 1
offset_left = -165.0
offset_top = -567.0
offset_right = 251.0
offset_bottom = -492.0
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("9_kek77")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 8
text = "These obelisks
will help you.
They will bounce magic 
spheres like you."
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="introLabel2" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=808141031]
z_index = -1
texture_filter = 1
offset_left = -167.0
offset_top = -430.0
offset_right = 249.0
offset_bottom = -355.0
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("9_kek77")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 8
text = "The smaller demons
Throw magic orbs at you.
To peacefully fight back,
parry their attacks back
at them"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="introLabel4" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=939301449]
z_index = -1
texture_filter = 1
offset_left = 66.0
offset_top = 87.0
offset_right = 482.0
offset_bottom = 162.0
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("9_kek77")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 8
text = "Both of these creatues together may
seem threatening, but you know their downfalls now.
Use their own powers to fight them
peacefully. And they are all suceptible to the
magic spheres, not just the smaller demons."
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="introLabel5" type="Label" parent="." unique_id=1372845346]
z_index = -1
texture_filter = 1
offset_left = 20.0
offset_top = -111.0
offset_right = 436.0
offset_bottom = -36.0
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("9_kek77")
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 8
text = "These larger demons don't have magic.
Instead, they will run up and hit you.
Simply parry their fists in their faces
three times to make them face their
own demise."
horizontal_alignment = 1

